<title>USA: Ferrofluidics names William Ford CFO.</title>
<headline>Ferrofluidics names William Ford CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NASHUA, N.H. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ferrofluidics Corp said Monday it had appointed William Ford as vice president and chief financial officer of the company.</p>
